# IG - Global Trading Platform

> IG is a global trading and investment platform founded in 1974, part of IG Group plc (FTSE 250). Regulated by top-tier authorities such as the FCA, AMF, and ASIC, IG provides access to over 17,000 financial markets worldwide. The specific availability of markets varies by user location due to regional regulations. IG's offerings include CFDs, spread betting (where permitted), share dealing, forex, commodities, indices, cryptocurrencies, and more, across a broad range of asset classes.

